```
And `writeJson` doesn't:
```dart
Future<void> writeJson(String path, Map<String, dynamic> data) =>
    File(path).writeAsString(jsonEncode(data));
```

But the ticket only asks about `file_write` matching Java FileTools.write. Let me verify the Java implementation to see exactly what behavior to port. Let me look for the Java FileTools.java.

